### WD-1912 — Order/getForzaGuides: guías de Forza de una orden

### Por número de orden
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaGuides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderNumber": "S01476" } }

### Por id de orden
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaGuides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderId": 2 } }

### Orden inexistente → 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaGuides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "order": { "orderId": 999999 } }
